<title>USA: Thermo Cardiosystems to buy back stock.</title>
<headline>Thermo Cardiosystems to buy back stock.</headline>
<dateline>WOBURN, Mass. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo Cardiosystems Inc said Friday it has authorized the repurchase of up to $20 million worth of its own common stock in the open market, or in negotiated transactions over the next year.</p>
<p>Thermo Cardiosystems will repurchase shares when they are available at prices the company considers attractive.</p>
<p>Thermo Cardiosystems Inc is a researcher, developer and manufacturer of implantable left ventricular-assist systems for the heart.</p>
